### SmartShip Logistics Management System - API Testing
### Complete Endpoint Test Suite
### Services Architecture:
###  - Gateway: http://localhost:5166 (API Gateway with Ocelot)
###  - Auth Service: http://localhost:5045
###  - Admin Service: http://localhost:5127
###  - Tracking Service: http://localhost:5062
###  - Shipment Service: http://localhost:5286

### ============================================================
### VARIABLES
### ============================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:5166
@auth_service = http://localhost:5045
@admin_service = http://localhost:5127
@tracking_service = http://localhost:5062
@shipment_service = http://localhost:5286

# These will be populated after login
@auth_token = 
@admin_token = 
@customer_token = 
@sample_shipment_id = 
@sample_user_id = 

### ============================================================
### 1. AUTH SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Register a new user (CUSTOMER)
POST {{auth_service}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer1",
  "email": "customer1@smartship.com",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 1.2 Register an admin user
POST {{auth_service}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "email": "admin1@smartship.com",
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 1.3 Login - Get JWT Token (Customer)
POST {{auth_service}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer1",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 1.4 Login - Get JWT Token (Admin)
POST {{auth_service}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 1.5 Refresh Token
POST {{auth_service}}/api/auth/refresh?token={{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.6 Revoke Token
POST {{auth_service}}/api/auth/revoke?token={{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.7 Get All Users (ADMIN only)
GET {{auth_service}}/api/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.8 Update User Role (ADMIN only)
PUT {{auth_service}}/api/auth/admin/users/{{sample_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

