### 3. SHIPMENT SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### 3.1 Create New Shipment (CUSTOMER only)
POST {{shipment_service}}/api/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderName": "John Doe",
  "senderAddress": "123 Main St, New York, NY 10001",
  "senderPhone": "+1-555-0123",
  "recipientName": "Jane Smith",
  "recipientAddress": "456 Oak Ave, Los Angeles, CA 90001",
  "recipientPhone": "+1-555-0456",
  "itemDescription": "Electronics Package",
  "weight": 2.5,
  "dimensions": "30x20x15 cm",
  "estimatedValue": 500.00,
  "serviceType": "EXPRESS"
}

### 3.2 Get My Shipments (CUSTOMER - their own shipments)
GET {{shipment_service}}/api/shipments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.3 Get Specific Shipment (CUSTOMER - own, ADMIN - any)
GET {{shipment_service}}/api/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.4 Book Shipment (CUSTOMER only - transitions Draft to Booked)
PUT {{shipment_service}}/api/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}/book
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.5 Cancel Shipment (CUSTOMER only - only Draft/Booked status)
DELETE {{shipment_service}}/api/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.6 Get All Shipments (ADMIN only - monitoring)
GET {{shipment_service}}/api/shipments/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.7 Update Shipment Status (ADMIN only)
PUT {{shipment_service}}/api/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

