### ============================================================
### 5. GATEWAY ENDPOINTS (Routing through Ocelot)
### ============================================================
### Gateway acts as API Gateway routing to all microservices
### Base URL: http://localhost:5166
### Routes:
###   - /auth/* → Auth Service (5045)
###   - /admin/* → Admin Service (5127)
###   - /shipments/* → Shipment Service (5286)
###   - /tracking/* → Tracking Service (5062)

